{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"e2ce375e60bacae3","__entryId":"active","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:10px\"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">订单金额</span><b>¥ 199.00</b></div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%;background:var(--brand-hover);transform:scale(.97);box-shadow:inset 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)\">立即支付</button>\n        <i class=\"hover-cursor\" style=\"right:36px;bottom:-11px\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:14px\">按下瞬间：scale(.97) + 颜色加深，给“按到了”的确定感</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">账号与安全</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">›</span></div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:9px 14px;background:var(--bg-hover);transform:scale(.99)\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">通知设置</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">›</span><i class=\"hover-cursor\" style=\"left:60px;bottom:-5px\"></i></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:9px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">隐私</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">›</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:10px\">列表项点按：背景变深 + 轻微下沉</div>","<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:180px;background:var(--bg);border:1.5px solid var(--text);border-radius:20px;padding:10px 8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding-bottom:7px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">我的</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">我的收藏</div>\n        <div style=\"position:relative;padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text);background:var(--brand-light);border-radius:6px\">消息中心\n          <i style=\"position:absolute;right:16px;top:50%;width:36px;height:36px;transform:translate(50%,-50%);border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(99,102,241,.35),transparent 70%)\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">设置</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 0 4px\">\n      <span class=\"icon-btn\">⏮</span>\n      <span style=\"position:relative\">\n        <i style=\"position:absolute;inset:-6px;border:1.5px solid rgba(99,102,241,.55);border-radius:12px\"></i>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"color:var(--brand);border-color:var(--brand);background:var(--brand-light);transform:scale(.88)\">▶</span>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"icon-btn\">⏭</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:8px\">图标按钮点击：缩小 + 涟漪扩散</div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:10px\"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">Order Total</span><b>¥ 199.00</b></div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%;background:var(--brand-hover);transform:scale(.97);box-shadow:inset 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)\">Pay Now</button>\n        <i class=\"hover-cursor\" style=\"right:36px;bottom:-11px\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:14px\">On press: scale(.97) + darker color — you can feel the click</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">Account & Security</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">›</span></div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:9px 14px;background:var(--bg-hover);transform:scale(.99)\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">Notifications</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">›</span><i class=\"hover-cursor\" style=\"left:60px;bottom:-5px\"></i></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:9px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">Privacy</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">›</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:10px\">List item press: darker background + slight sink</div>","<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:180px;background:var(--bg);border:1.5px solid var(--text);border-radius:20px;padding:10px 8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding-bottom:7px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">Me</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Favorites</div>\n        <div style=\"position:relative;padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text);background:var(--brand-light);border-radius:6px\">Messages\n          <i style=\"position:absolute;right:16px;top:50%;width:36px;height:36px;transform:translate(50%,-50%);border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(99,102,241,.35),transparent 70%)\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Settings</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 0 4px\">\n      <span class=\"icon-btn\">⏮</span>\n      <span style=\"position:relative\">\n        <i style=\"position:absolute;inset:-6px;border:1.5px solid rgba(99,102,241,.55);border-radius:12px\"></i>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"color:var(--brand);border-color:var(--brand);background:var(--brand-light);transform:scale(.88)\">▶</span>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"icon-btn\">⏭</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:8px\">Icon button press: shrinks with a ripple</div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"rest\"><span class=\"active-btn\">按钮</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"press\"><span class=\"active-anat-chip\">👇 按下瞬间</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"sink\"><span class=\"active-btn is-active\">按钮</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"rest\"><span class=\"active-btn\">Button</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"press\"><span class=\"active-anat-chip\">👇 Press instantly</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"sink\"><span class=\"active-btn is-active\">Button</span></span>","parts":[{"key":"rest","cn":"常态","en":"Rest","desc":"没被按下时的样子","desc_en":"How it looks when nothing is pressed"},{"key":"press","cn":"按下瞬间","en":"Press","desc":"指针按下到松手之间的那一瞬","desc_en":"The instant between pointer-down and release"},{"key":"sink","cn":"下沉反馈","en":"Sink","desc":"scale .97 或加深颜色，给“按到了”的感觉","desc_en":"scale .97 or a darker color — the feeling of “it registered”"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"缩小下沉","en":"Scale","demo":"<span class=\"active-v\"><span class=\"active-v-btn\">按钮</span><span class=\"active-v-btn v-scale\">按钮</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"active-v\"><span class=\"active-v-btn\">Button</span><span class=\"active-v-btn v-scale\">Button</span></span>","when":"按钮按下的标配反馈","when_en":"The standard press feedback for buttons"},{"cn":"颜色加深","en":"Darken","demo":"<span class=\"active-v\"><span class=\"active-v-btn\">按钮</span><span class=\"active-v-btn v-dark\">按钮</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"active-v\"><span class=\"active-v-btn\">Button</span><span class=\"active-v-btn v-dark\">Button</span></span>","when":"不便形变时的替代方案","when_en":"The fallback when scaling isn't an option"},{"cn":"凹陷","en":"Inset","demo":"<span class=\"active-v\"><span class=\"active-v-btn v-inset\">按钮</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"active-v\"><span class=\"active-v-btn v-inset\">Button</span></span>","when":"开关、拨杆的物理感","when_en":"Physical feel for toggles and levers"}],"use":[{"t":"让按钮轻微下沉或加深颜色，反馈已经按下","m":"active-sink"},{"t":"<b>改变颜色</b>：不适合缩放的小图标或文字按钮也能表达按下状态","m":"active-darken"},{"t":"<b>反馈及时出现</b>：按下时应可感知，具体时长随输入方式和动效系统调整","m":"active-fast"},{"t":"<b>列表项、{c:card} 点按</b>：需要表达可点击时可补按下反馈；不要让纯展示内容伪装成可操作","m":"active-list"}],"dont":[{"t":"<b>与 {c:hover} 使用完全相同的样式</b>：用户难以确认是否已经按下","m":"active-same-hover","bad":true},{"t":"<b>缺少按下反馈</b>：用户可能重复触发操作","m":"active-none","bad":true},{"t":"<b>形变幅度过大</b>：会干扰按下状态的识别","m":"active-overdo","bad":true},{"t":"把按下样式<b>当作已选中状态</b>：active 是短暂状态，选中状态需要持续显示","m":"active-as-selected","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"提交按钮按下到松开的瞬间没有任何变化，用户经常连续点两次。怎样补充反馈？","options":[{"id":"brief-press-feedback","label":"在按下期间轻微改变颜色或位置，松开后恢复，并支持键盘激活","feedback":"短暂变化直接回应输入动作，恢复后也不会被误认为持续选中或禁用状态。","correct":true},{"id":"persistent-selected-style","label":"第一次点击后一直保持按下样式，直到用户再次点击","feedback":"持续样式表达的是切换或选中，不是从按下到松开的瞬时反馈。","correct":false},{"id":"hover-only-feedback","label":"只保留悬停变色，按下到松开期间不增加反馈，因为 hover 已经说明能点","feedback":"悬停只提示指针所在位置，不能确认已经按下；键盘激活时也可能没有这层提示。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A submit button shows no change between pointer down and release, so users often click twice. What feedback should be added?","options":[{"id":"brief-press-feedback","label":"Change color or position slightly while pressed, restore on release, and support keyboard activation","feedback":"A brief change responds directly to input and restores before it can be mistaken for selection or disablement.","correct":true},{"id":"persistent-selected-style","label":"Keep the pressed style after the first click until the user clicks again","feedback":"Persistent styling expresses a toggle or selection rather than the moment from press to release.","correct":false},{"id":"hover-only-feedback","label":"Keep only the hover color and add no press-to-release feedback because hover already shows it is clickable","feedback":"Hover only shows where the pointer is; it does not confirm a press and may not appear during keyboard activation.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请给提交按钮补充短暂按下状态：指针或键盘按下时轻微加深或下沉，松开、移出或取消时立即恢复。不要把它做成持续选中态，也不要改变周围布局。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Add a brief pressed state to the submit button: darken or lower it slightly during pointer or keyboard press, then restore on release, leave, or cancel. Do not turn it into persistent selection or shift surrounding layout."}},"demoDetail":"<div class=\"active-play\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"active-live-btn\">按住我</button>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"active-half-btn\">只有 hover</button>\n    <span class=\"active-live-item\">列表项也能按</span>\n    <span class=\"active-hint\">按住左侧按钮可看到缩放变化；右侧按钮没有单独的按下状态</span>\n  </div>","references":[{"title":":active 伪类","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/:active","title_en":":active"}],"scenes":["按钮按下瞬间","列表项点按反馈","移动端触摸反馈","图标按钮点击"],"en":{"demoDetail":"<div class=\"active-play\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"active-live-btn\">Hold me</button>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"active-half-btn\">Hover only</button>\n    <span class=\"active-live-item\">List items press too</span>\n    <span class=\"active-hint\">Hold to see the sink (scale .96), release to bounce back; the right button lacks active and feels dead</span>\n  </div>","use":[{"t":"Give a button press physical feedback","m":"active-sink"},{"t":"Show a menu item while it is being clicked","m":"active-darken"},{"t":"Respond to a pointer or key press","m":"active-fast"},{"t":"Complete the hover-focus-active state set","m":"active-list"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use active styling as the permanent selected state","m":"active-same-hover","bad":true},{"t":"Scale a control so far that the layout jumps","m":"active-none","bad":true},{"t":"Remove all feedback during a press","m":"active-overdo","bad":true},{"t":"Make the pressed state look disabled","m":"active-as-selected","bad":true}],"scenes":["Button press","Navigation item","Icon control","Card action"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:10px\"><span style=\"color:var(--text-2)\">Order Total</span><b>¥ 199.00</b></div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%;background:var(--brand-hover);transform:scale(.97);box-shadow:inset 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)\">Pay Now</button>\n        <i class=\"hover-cursor\" style=\"right:36px;bottom:-11px\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:14px\">On press: scale(.97) + darker color — you can feel the click</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:9px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">Account & Security</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">›</span></div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:9px 14px;background:var(--bg-hover);transform:scale(.99)\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">Notifications</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">›</span><i class=\"hover-cursor\" style=\"left:60px;bottom:-5px\"></i></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:9px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">Privacy</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">›</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:10px\">List item press: darker background + slight sink</div>","<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:180px;background:var(--bg);border:1.5px solid var(--text);border-radius:20px;padding:10px 8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding-bottom:7px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">Me</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Favorites</div>\n        <div style=\"position:relative;padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text);background:var(--brand-light);border-radius:6px\">Messages\n          <i style=\"position:absolute;right:16px;top:50%;width:36px;height:36px;transform:translate(50%,-50%);border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(99,102,241,.35),transparent 70%)\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Settings</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 0 4px\">\n      <span class=\"icon-btn\">⏮</span>\n      <span style=\"position:relative\">\n        <i style=\"position:absolute;inset:-6px;border:1.5px solid rgba(99,102,241,.55);border-radius:12px\"></i>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\" style=\"color:var(--brand);border-color:var(--brand);background:var(--brand-light);transform:scale(.88)\">▶</span>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"icon-btn\">⏭</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:8px\">Icon button press: shrinks with a ripple</div>"]},"usageMocks":{"active-sink":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">按钮</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"transform:scale(.96);background:var(--brand-hover)\">按钮</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">轻微缩放可以表现按下期间的状态变化</span>","active-darken":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">提交</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"background:var(--brand-hover)\">提交</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">不适合缩放时，可通过颜色变化表达按下状态</span>","active-fast":"<span class=\"mk-tag blue\">按下即反馈</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:150px\">及时可感知；具体时长按输入方式和动效系统调整</span>","active-list":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"padding:4px;gap:2px\"><span style=\"display:block;padding:4px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">列表项一</span><span style=\"display:block;padding:4px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text);background:var(--bg-hover);border-radius:4px;transform:scale(.99)\">列表项二（按下中）</span><span style=\"display:block;padding:4px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">列表项三</span></div>","active-same-hover":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"background:var(--brand-hover)\">悬停</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"background:var(--brand-hover)\">按下</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">两种状态外观相同，用户难以确认是否已经按下</span>","active-none":"<span class=\"mk-btn primary\">确定</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:150px\">点下去毫无变化，用户怀疑没点上，于是又点了一次</span>","active-overdo":"<span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"transform:translateY(6px) scale(.8)\">按钮</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">缩放和位移过大，会干扰按下反馈</span>","active-as-selected":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"background:var(--brand-hover);transform:scale(.96)\">按下状态</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:130px\">按下是短暂状态，不能代替持续的选中状态</span></div>"}}}